      "session_id": "nebula-gdd-9c9b432e56-mechanics",
      "document_changes": {
        "updated_html": "<h1 data-chunk-id=\"2196978e-cf05-4ae1-99f0-347b04d9e8a1\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;border-bottom:3px solid #0d47a1;padding-bottom:6px\">Nebula Drift - Mechanics</h1>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"056cdb25-8e88-4e52-8481-c26527857fbd\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">Vantage Nine Studios - internal - sub-document of the Nebula Drift GDD. Source of truth for every tunable number.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"42d10a42-88ff-4413-9297-3f520a9167c0\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">How to read this document</h2>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"8613e704-d532-452c-92af-5e8aa6756998\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">One section per mechanic. Every tunable number in the game\nappears here exactly once and is referenced from the GDD as prose. If a number\nappears in two places, this one wins.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"f4b01c8d-296b-4d3c-a37f-2bfbf488d650\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Dash</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"d7ab93a9-ed2e-4b3c-97ee-b9c52b832acd\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Distance</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">5.5 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Two tiles. Tuned so a dash clears the standard gap.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">1.8 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Short enough to chain, long enough to read.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">I-frames</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0.15 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Start of dash only.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"07a13c2c-e103-48e0-ac98-7e6337888c1f\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Wall-run</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"3db097b6-9098-4b14-90fd-4f1c9f063fd6\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Max duration</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">2.0 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Falls off rather than stopping dead.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Speed retained</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">85%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Deliberately lossy: wall-run is a connector, not a route.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Re-attach window</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0.4 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Allows a corner without a full reset.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"8491c960-f8db-444b-928d-254aac2dbd6c\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Grapple</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"214b47df-2cd4-4cfa-9e2c-8df39c391577\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Range</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">18 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Reads at speed; longer felt like teleporting.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">5 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">It is now paced against the overheat pulse.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Speed on release</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">140%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">The only system that converts height into speed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Attach angle</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">60 deg cone</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Forgiving, because the camera is not.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"c3ba7bc2-37c6-4300-a8a9-e2c59262a43f\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Overheat pulse</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"6deb8160-7e9a-441a-a8bc-2241d52ca987\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Radius</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">4 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Defensive only. Never damages.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">6 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Paced against the grapple so they compete.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Stagger duration</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">1.1 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Enough to route past, not enough to farm.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"9b304df1-77bc-447e-a3f7-449f37a0dab3\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Salvage economy</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"222436d4-59bf-41c6-ad21-64e2ede2984e\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Base yield per node</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">12 units</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Flat. Rarity lives in placement, not in rolls.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Upgrade cost curve</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">60 / 140 / 260</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Three tiers, no branching.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Decay on death</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Death costs progress through the sector, not currency.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
